<h3>About EMSOFT</h3> 
 
<p align="justify"> 
The International Conference on Embedded Software (EMSOFT) brings together
researchers and developers from academia, industry, and government to
advance the science, engineering, and technology in embedded software
development. </p> 
 
<p>EMSOFT 2010 (the 10th in the series!)
is part of <a href="http://www.esweek.org">Embedded Systems Week</a>.

<p>
Please visit <a href="http://www.esweek.org">www.esweek.org</a> 
for venue and travel information. 
 
 
